{"air_date":"2026-02-17T00:00:00.0000000Z","episode_number":149,"name":"兵秘龙脉藏","overview":"叶凡为寻兵字秘前往秦岭，锁定隐匿于破败门派秦门的狠人传承者华云飞。他易容潜入秦门东脉，救下被欺负的小师弟，得知秦门建在龙脉之上，且藏有龙髓。随后，叶凡结识看似病弱、实则实力深不可测的病老人，在其指引下取得上品龙髓，实力进一步提升。与此同时，华云飞在秦岭洞穴吸收古尸本源，突破至化龙第八变，并与彻底反目的李小曼联手，密谋截杀叶凡、夺取九秘。","id":6801178,"production_code":"","season_number":1,"still_path":"/kZ1K13B7LrKn249yYrE0h0NHJWX.jpg","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"images":{"stills":[{"aspect_ratio":1.778,"file_path":"/kZ1K13B7LrKn249yYrE0h0NHJWX.jpg","height":2160,"vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1,"width":3840},{"aspect_ratio":1.778,"file_path":"/14HNlU9ZxmDE5Mvz4C1XVwSelJn.jpg","height":2160,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"width":3840}]},"external_ids":{},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":3171093,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"赵乾景","original_name":"赵乾景","popularity":0.9192,"profile_path":"/6QRgZZZhwee5md1W5kgeCEScvQI.jpg","cast_id":0,"character":"庞博 (voice)","credit_id":"66adf06a997f6a6931f9268f","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":3718828,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"李婵妃","original_name":"李婵妃","popularity":0.6273,"profile_path":"/9lPXNOqWemS1gilUTsRQcyG8wnX.jpg","cast_id":0,"character":"姬紫月 (voice)","credit_id":"66adf07f7443f27979bd7b9c","order":1},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2723047,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"徐翔","original_name":"Xiang Xu","popularity":0.5073,"profile_path":"/hE2BnMQ7KoGyEyM3fNPCWzALLCk.jpg","cast_id":0,"character":"叶凡 (voice)","credit_id":"66adf08f25446b17dec0517c","order":2},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2837759,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"吴磊","original_name":"吴磊","popularity":1.2648,"profile_path":"/z1Aw5fyYAND8EOthud6gbIV22rk.jpg","cast_id":0,"character":"段德 (voice)","credit_id":"66adf11e9a5f43de29d31085","order":3},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":3718807,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"张若瑜","original_name":"Ruoyu Zhang","popularity":0.4343,"profile_path":"/xqmmuN34EtJ50xqqrvD3fB7QVX4.jpg","cast_id":0,"character":"狠人大帝 (voice)","credit